OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F163A1787404689
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sat 5 Sep to Sat 19 Sep
OL,6,FMost likely changeable at first with
OL,7,Fshowers or longer spells of rain
OL,8,Facross many areas, perhaps heavy and
OL,9,Fthundery in places. Further into
OL,10,FSeptember, drier weather may become
OL,11,Fmore prevalent, especially in the
OL,12,Fsouth and southeast, with any more
OL,13,Funsettled conditions tending to become
OL,14,Fconfined further north and northwest.
OL,15,FTemperatures will probably be near
OL,16,Fnormal at first, but may turn warmer
OL,17,Flater with a chance of some hot
OL,18,Fperiods in the south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
